Modified for Tinkery on 2026-10-15:
- src/lib.rs: remove linker and wikilink module declarations and their re-exports
  (FileData, resolve_links, scan_markdown_files, add_wikilink, remove_wikilink).
  Rustfmt reorders the remaining graph/settings re-exports after those removals.
- Cargo.toml: remove the graf [[bin]] target and package.metadata.deb and
  package.metadata.generate-rpm sections; this copy is a hosted library, not a
  standalone application or OS package. Remove Cargo.lock and
  src/default_config.toml from the package include list because they are omitted.
  Remove clap, toml, directories, chrono, regex and glob dependencies used only
  by the omitted application/configuration/scanning modules. Remove the unused
  direct petgraph dependency; kept modules use fdg_sim::petgraph instead.
- API.md: describe the library-only copy, use a local path dependency, remove
  scanner/link resolution/wikilink editing sections and references, describe
  Serde settings without bundling a TOML parser, and correct the layer-count
  wording. Hosts own data loading and content transforms.

Omitted upstream files:
- src/main.rs, src/cli.rs, src/app.rs, src/ui.rs: standalone executable, command
  line, application state and application UI; Tend supplies its own host.
- src/config.rs, src/default_config.toml: standalone configuration discovery,
  filesystem loading/writing and defaults; the library retains Settings.
- src/linker.rs, src/wikilink.rs: markdown scanning/link resolution and markdown
  content editing; Tend supplies NodeSpec data and owns any durable changes.
- src/util.rs: truncate is used only by the omitted src/ui.rs, not the library.
- .github/dependabot.yml, .github/workflows/beta.yml,
  .github/workflows/ci.yml, .github/workflows/release.yml: upstream automation;
  the enclosing workspace owns CI.
- .gitignore: upstream checkout ignore rules are not needed in this vendor copy.
- Cargo.lock: the enclosing workspace owns dependency resolution.
- PKGBUILD, flake.nix, flake.lock: standalone distribution/build packaging.
- cliff.toml, deny.toml: upstream release and dependency-audit configuration.
- .git checkout metadata is not copied.

Kept unchanged: LICENSE, README.md, CHANGELOG.md, src/graph.rs, src/input.rs,
src/physics.rs, src/render.rs, src/settings.rs, src/theme.rs, src/viewport.rs.
All upstream tests in the kept modules are retained. None of the omitted
modules is required by the kept library. The workspace includes graf-rs for
build/test/lint checks; Tinkery does not yet depend on it.
